Examples for: Orders

Background:
  Cleo is a Customer
  Sam is a Viewer

Example: A customer places an order and sends it off for its credit check
  Given Cleo places an order with number "A-100" and customer "Cleo Ng"
  When Cleo submits it
  Then the order is submitted

Example: Only a customer can send an order off
  Given Cleo places an order with number "A-100" and customer "Cleo Ng"
  When Sam tries to submit it
  Then it is refused because only a Customer may do it

Example: An order that was already sent off cannot be sent again
  Given Cleo places an order with number "A-100" and customer "Cleo Ng"
  And Cleo submits it
  When Cleo tries to submit it
  Then it is refused because only a draft can be submitted
